      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Spacious 1 & 2 Bedroom Bungalows for sale in Ratoath for the over 55s or those with a medical need.\r\n\r\nShowhouse open Sunday 19th July from 12pm to 2pm.\r\n\r\nOpen Viewings Wednesday & Thursdays 11-3pm.\r\n\r\nPrices from 395,000 - Contact DNG Tormey Lee on 01 835 7089\r\n\r\n\r\nA vibrant lifestyle awaits\r\n\r\nCormill is a new development of A-rated 1 & 2 bedroom homes in the village of Ratoath, Co. Meath. Designed for people who want to live in a modern, comfortable energy efficient space that they can age into and an ideal option for those looking to downsize. The boutique development of just 18 bungalows offers homeowners enjoyable, low-maintenance living in a new community close to the village of Ratoath with all your day to day needs on your doorstep. While the homes may be purchased by anybody, occupancy is restricted to the over 55's or those with a certified medical need.\r\n\r\n\r\nRatoath\r\nSituated just a short stroll from Ratoath village centre, residents enjoy immediate access to shops, cafés, restaurants, schools, and sporting facilities, with excellent transport links to Dublin, Ashbourne, and surrounding areas.\r\nThis is a unique opportunity to secure a modern bungalow in a prime village location—ideal for those seeking to simplify their lifestyle while upgrading their quality of living.\r\n\r\nLink below to website;\r\nhttps://staging2.cornmill.ie/#next\r\n\r\nSome images may have been digitally enhanced or virtually altered / staged to illustrate the property's potential. All measurements and floor areas are approximate and have been given in good faith. Prospective purchasers should satisfy themselves as to the accuracy of all details and measurements through their own inspection."
